    "text": "播結結結詹",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "2-2",
    "audio_sha256": "c922f78e1c2b75b3e3e8c0cf861ca42f66e522248835abb67c1733b7392d75a8",
    "text": "一 挨二 rest三哦四腰五我",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "3-2",
    "audio_sha256": "0f49c0292a11a9233239c36fb89525c9ea12a44c6cc2baa851c84bdf9d11eff1",
    "text": "一 二二 儿子三 女儿四 儿 女五 二 多",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "4-9",
    "audio_sha256": "89ada13ca38996a455b4f1191ab23fe5bb2257d4892f5491cf0aac947b03c6f6",
    "text": "你好,我叫李君,你叫什么名字?你好,我叫马利,你是留学生吗?不是,我是中国学生,你学什么?我学汉语",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "4-10",
    "audio_sha256": "9b4419265ba47e5f3d02a393ce8ae8de128171c4ab51426b210dd88c8f039921",
    "text": "他是中国学生吗不是,他是老师他信什么他信王是王老师",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "5-9",
    "audio_sha256": "e38dfa2565b28c524c36c2e5ebef2122f2f8091957d2ad28a02d62df81134c8e",
    "text": "大位你好,这是我的同学叫李美你好,李美,认识你很高兴我也很高兴,我是韩国留学生,你呢?我是美国留学生,马力是我的好朋友",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "5-11",
    "audio_sha256": "7c3f07c2af95575be5ee216bb0b009fcff326cde4ee32b59a198e0ae49e5412c",
    "text": "你們好,我叫馬克是英國人這是我的好朋友利利,他也是英國人我們是北京大學的留學生,很高興認識你們",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "6-8",
    "audio_sha256": "33a5ff340dc6507068423dd398067297a42ae545e7ce758ec1e0446e036b0960",
    "text": "大位,那是什么?是书是什么书?谁的?你的吗?是汉语书,不是我的,是我同屋的",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "6-10",
    "audio_sha256": "7419a1662c48debebc4fef2e834a42b7b8cc3da84f395043ea03fa01621e0878",
    "text": "我叫大位,我来介绍一下,他们是我的同学,这是马力,是加拿大人,这是中村,是日本人,我们是很好的朋友,这是我们的教室,我们的教室很大",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "7-8",
    "audio_sha256": "f05738f0f862d1f05a5cd2889a4d961fc9b97ba9b70fb824ae1ded55745d5a49",
    "text": "大位,你住在哪儿?我住在学校的留学生宿舍里,你呢?马利。我住在学校外边,中国人的家里,远吗?不远,就在学校的东边,欢迎去我家玩。",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "7-10",
    "audio_sha256": "5ffb2a9113645be33738ba83da0c1fad61c2ce5f8b857d121968371982ee0889",
    "text": "我來介紹一下,這是張宏,我的中國朋友,他是北京大學的研究生,他的專業也是國際關係,他的家就在我們學校的東邊。他歡迎我們去他家玩,我很高興認識他。",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "8-8",
    "audio_sha256": "81d4b24d2c447c0057c51ca0e3742e4556c45eb0a01c0b8765ed70c71939ebb1",
    "text": "李君,明天晚上你有时间吗?有啊,什么事?明天是历历的生日,我们一起吃饭吧!好,几点,在哪儿?晚上六点半,在历历的宿舍。",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "8-10",
    "audio_sha256": "6ea1d6d30878aecaa34e66f6d2dc4748b79c6edd13f9af5772eb18c3faa1fc0d",
    "text": "马力 明天你有课吗明天上午有课 下午没有课上午几点下课差十分十点下课 有事吗没事 我十二点下课 中午一起吃饭吧好啊 十二点一课十堂见",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "9-10",
    "audio_sha256": "3052bff3eb1742878c32eb2f1c43d0d83164bac21bb390602fbd0d42da4608a8",
    "text": "大位,我和安娜星期六上午去东午员,你有时间一起去吗?有时间,我们怎么去,骑自行车吗?不,坐地铁吧,地铁四号线好,我们几点在哪见呢?九点在学校东门见",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "9-11",
    "audio_sha256": "cd69344bd55cd7edfb3f173d73482bbbf837d5f087766b79be01ac82d4ec7708",
    "text": "玛利 你有李老师的电话号码吗?有 他办公室的电话号码是62572305他不在办公室 你有他的手机号吗?我没有老师的手机号 我有他的微信号那我加一下他的微信吧",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "10-10",
    "audio_sha256": "f9ea37972d00c9a2edf1f3d146c105a3adf3b6706a0da03afcd9af4b8a1549fd",
    "text": "師傅,西瓜怎麼賣?西瓜兩塊五億金,你要多少?我要這半個西瓜多少錢?八斤二十塊給你錢",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  },
  {
    "audio_id": "10-11",
    "audio_sha256": "84a50bcc277bbe2cc452d18a8a40112a5c5b226940ed5ad5071e7603aed12fc8",
    "text": "9點在學校東門見你要什麼?一杯啤酒我不要酒,要一杯咖啡吧我也要一杯咖啡服務員,兩杯咖啡好,您的兩杯咖啡多少錢?我少微信吧好的,25塊錢一杯,1過50",
    "status": "auxiliary-only; phonetic/tone/homophone/digit recognition not authoritative"
  }
]